1
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,599
(Episode 13)

2
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,920
(This is a work of fiction.)

3
00:02:19,239 --> 00:02:21,119
- Hello? - Ms. Wong.

4
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,599
I'm Celine, Counselor Yau's apprentice.

5
00:02:23,959 --> 00:02:26,479
We found out that Mr. Chow Kwai Hing's daughter...

6
00:02:26,559 --> 00:02:27,719
is not his biological child.

7
00:02:27,799 --> 00:02:30,479
After she found out, she withdrew from the inheritance dispute.

8
00:02:30,799 --> 00:02:33,719
So you will be the heir to Mr. Chow Kwai Hing's estate.

9
00:02:36,279 --> 00:02:38,119
Was it Ms. Yau who found out?

10
00:02:38,839 --> 00:02:42,079
Yes, she has always been good at finding clues in the details.

11
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,559
But I still don't want it.

12
00:02:50,999 --> 00:02:53,559
She told me to ask you to take a look...

13
00:02:53,799 --> 00:02:56,719
in the secret compartment behind Hing's fanny pack.

14
00:02:56,999 --> 00:02:58,439
Decide after you've seen it.

15
00:03:46,959 --> 00:03:47,959
Mui.

16
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,919
When I got married,

17
00:03:56,799 --> 00:03:59,239
it was during the boom years when everyone lived in luxury.

18
00:04:00,519 --> 00:04:02,199
Any business could make money.

19
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,358
Unfortunately, a financial storm hit,

20
00:04:04,359 --> 00:04:05,559
and I lost everything.

21
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:08,359
When my wife found out I was bankrupt,

22
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,159
even though she was pregnant with our daughter,

23
00:04:10,399 --> 00:04:11,959
she wanted a divorce immediately.

24
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:15,759
She took everything of value with her.

25
00:04:19,159 --> 00:04:20,239
Later,

26
00:04:21,679 --> 00:04:23,719
she only came back to find me when she needed something.

27
00:04:24,599 --> 00:04:27,999
It was always for money.

28
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:32,319
She squeezed every penny out of me.

29
00:04:35,119 --> 00:04:37,719
When I was homeless and asked for help,

30
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,599
she ignored me.

31
00:04:41,479 --> 00:04:42,479
Not long after,

32
00:04:44,559 --> 00:04:47,159
I saw her on the street with another man.

33
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,079
Since then,

34
00:04:54,559 --> 00:04:55,799
I stopped trusting people.

35
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:58,319
Especially women.

36
00:05:00,719 --> 00:05:02,119
So I didn't think about anything else.

37
00:05:02,999 --> 00:05:05,439
I just focused on working hard...

38
00:05:06,999 --> 00:05:09,159
until the bankruptcy order ended.

39
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,679
I didn't dare spend money recklessly,

40
00:05:14,199 --> 00:05:16,159
nor did I dare tell anyone how much I had.

41
00:05:16,599 --> 00:05:19,919
I just used whatever I earned to buy stocks every month.

42
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:26,839
Ever since...

43
00:05:28,159 --> 00:05:29,159
I met you,

44
00:05:31,999 --> 00:05:33,559
I knew you were sincere with me.

45
00:05:35,799 --> 00:05:37,039
I thought about...

46
00:05:38,039 --> 00:05:39,239
telling you,

47
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:42,119
but the shadows of the past were too great.

48
00:05:44,359 --> 00:05:46,719
I didn't know how to bring it up.

49
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,279
I got cancer.

50
00:05:56,239 --> 00:05:57,599
You knew I was penniless,

51
00:05:57,679 --> 00:05:58,879
yet you still took care of me.

52
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,799
The burden was so heavy,

53
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:04,199
but you kept giving silently.

54
00:06:06,119 --> 00:06:08,799
You never expected anything in return.

55
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:14,759
I know...

56
00:06:17,359 --> 00:06:18,679
that your feelings for me are real.

57
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:23,559
I regret not telling you.

58
00:06:26,239 --> 00:06:28,119
But it's too late now.

59
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,079
Mui.

60
00:06:37,359 --> 00:06:39,359
I know I've caused you a lot of pain.

61
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:42,399
I really want...

62
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:45,559
to leave you that money.

63
00:06:48,359 --> 00:06:49,839
When I was alive,

64
00:06:51,559 --> 00:06:53,039
I couldn't make you happy.

65
00:06:55,479 --> 00:06:56,879
I hope that after I'm gone,

66
00:06:58,999 --> 00:07:00,839
I can do something for you.

67
00:07:04,479 --> 00:07:06,079
This is my only wish.

68
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:10,039
If you're willing to accept it,

69
00:07:12,679 --> 00:07:13,839
I'll be very happy.

70
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,959
Actually, being with you,

71
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:29,039
even if we were poor,

72
00:07:30,999 --> 00:07:33,039
I was still very happy.

73
00:07:36,479 --> 00:07:37,599
What I want...

74
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:40,479
isn't money.

75
00:07:45,119 --> 00:07:46,239
I know what you want.

76
00:08:42,199 --> 00:08:44,399
Hello, Celine.

77
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:47,119
This is Ms. Wong.

78
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:51,359
I've decided to accept Hing's inheritance.

79
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,359
Please handle it for me.

80
00:09:10,416 --> 00:09:12,096
What time is it now?

81
00:09:13,656 --> 00:09:16,856
Time doesn't matter. What's the difference?

82
00:09:18,176 --> 00:09:20,656
Why don't we go out and patrol?

83
00:09:22,576 --> 00:09:24,136
What's there to patrol here?

84
00:09:24,216 --> 00:09:25,936
It's always the same.

85
00:09:28,816 --> 00:09:30,616
It's so hard.

86
00:09:31,456 --> 00:09:35,056
When can we finally leave this place?

87
00:09:36,856 --> 00:09:39,096
That idiot had to wait for someone to make a mistake...

88
00:09:39,176 --> 00:09:40,656
and get demoted here before he could leave.

89
00:09:40,856 --> 00:09:41,936
Think about it.

90
00:09:42,616 --> 00:09:45,176
Then how long did he have to wait?

91
00:09:46,536 --> 00:09:47,536
3,000 years.

92
00:09:53,496 --> 00:09:54,536
Then why don't we...

93
00:09:55,136 --> 00:09:57,616
Why don't we think of a way to get out of here?

94
00:09:57,696 --> 00:10:00,536
Forget it. Just keep lying there.

95
00:10:03,856 --> 00:10:05,296
It's not like there's no way.

96
00:10:07,016 --> 00:10:09,256
- King Yama! - King Yama!

97
00:10:09,336 --> 00:10:11,776
King Yama, I missed you so much.

98
00:10:12,816 --> 00:10:13,816
Wait a minute.

99
00:10:14,256 --> 00:10:16,136
Why are you here?

100
00:10:16,416 --> 00:10:18,056
Yeah, why are you here?

101
00:10:18,536 --> 00:10:19,896
I was the one in charge of this place.

102
00:10:19,976 --> 00:10:21,336
How could I not know my way around?

103
00:10:23,816 --> 00:10:25,976
King Yama, do you really have a way...

104
00:10:26,336 --> 00:10:27,936
to take us out of here?

105
00:10:32,896 --> 00:10:35,216
That depends on whether you're brave enough.

106
00:11:02,736 --> 00:11:06,296
My line used to extend to my palm.

107
00:11:06,776 --> 00:11:07,856
Now it has gotten shorter.

108
00:11:08,896 --> 00:11:10,376
But I haven't been out.

109
00:11:10,776 --> 00:11:11,936
I haven't gone out to accumulate merit.

110
00:11:12,696 --> 00:11:13,936
Why is this happening?

111
00:11:16,056 --> 00:11:18,496
Looks like King Yama was right.

112
00:11:18,936 --> 00:11:20,296
So should we take a gamble?

113
00:11:20,936 --> 00:11:22,096
Of course we should.

114
00:11:26,216 --> 00:11:27,936
We can help you clean up your mess,

115
00:11:28,776 --> 00:11:29,816
but you have to listen to us.

116
00:11:30,656 --> 00:11:32,536
Fine. What do I have to do?

117
00:11:33,016 --> 00:11:34,416
We'll take you to see the Emperor.

118
00:11:34,936 --> 00:11:36,616
You'll tell him personally that you want to appeal...

119
00:11:36,936 --> 00:11:38,456
and have the case sent back for retrial.

120
00:11:39,176 --> 00:11:40,176
No problem.

121
00:11:43,936 --> 00:11:44,936
Whatever happens, happens.

122
00:11:44,976 --> 00:11:46,256
I don't want to stay here for thousands of years anyway.

123
00:11:52,616 --> 00:11:53,896
Don't try any tricks.

124
00:12:00,776 --> 00:12:01,776
Be careful.

125
00:12:11,296 --> 00:12:12,376
Thank you for your hard work.

126
00:12:13,096 --> 00:12:15,056
You'll come back to save me, right?

127
00:12:15,416 --> 00:12:16,416
Of course we will.

128
00:12:18,136 --> 00:12:19,136
Tall as a bull.

129
00:12:20,416 --> 00:12:21,536
Large as a horse.

130
00:12:25,376 --> 00:12:26,376
Let's go.

131
00:12:31,136 --> 00:12:33,016
Don't forget about me!

132
00:12:35,776 --> 00:12:37,415
(Mother of Inmate Who Committed Suicide...)

133
00:12:37,416 --> 00:12:38,976
(Returns to Hong Kong Upon Receiving the Devastating News)

134
00:12:46,376 --> 00:12:48,536
Hello, I'm looking for Ms. Chiu Man Wah.

135
00:12:48,816 --> 00:12:50,296
Who's asking for her?

136
00:12:50,536 --> 00:12:52,216
I'm a home maintenance volunteer.

137
00:12:52,296 --> 00:12:54,136
Is there anything in your home that needs fixing?

138
00:12:57,176 --> 00:12:58,176
All done.

139
00:13:01,136 --> 00:13:02,216
You're such a kind person.

140
00:13:02,456 --> 00:13:04,056
Call me anytime if you need help.

141
00:13:04,256 --> 00:13:05,616
I love helping people the most.

142
00:13:11,296 --> 00:13:13,216
Hello, this is for you guys.

143
00:13:14,176 --> 00:13:15,696
Thank you. We have food now!

144
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:17,336
Let me know if you need anything.

145
00:13:17,416 --> 00:13:19,216
I can arrange for a social worker to help you get public housing.

146
00:13:26,416 --> 00:13:27,416
Let me help you.

147
00:13:27,417 --> 00:13:28,496
Okay, thank you.

148
00:13:36,776 --> 00:13:38,856
I've been so busy working in the Mainland...

149
00:13:38,936 --> 00:13:40,936
that I didn't take good care of him.

150
00:13:41,936 --> 00:13:44,976
I've failed him.

151
00:13:45,776 --> 00:13:46,776
I understand.

152
00:13:47,936 --> 00:13:49,656
Actually, my mother committed suicide too.

153
00:13:55,016 --> 00:13:56,456
So if you ever need to talk...

154
00:13:56,856 --> 00:13:59,496
or want some company, call me anytime.

155
00:14:00,496 --> 00:14:01,536
I'll be there right away.

156
00:14:02,936 --> 00:14:04,056
Thank you.

157
00:14:05,176 --> 00:14:07,176
Which church do you volunteer for?

158
00:14:10,376 --> 00:14:11,615
The Church of Amber.

159
00:14:11,616 --> 00:14:14,616
(The Church of Amber's Volunteer Team)

160
00:14:17,456 --> 00:14:18,536
What is this place?

161
00:14:18,816 --> 00:14:19,816
Suicide Hell.

162
00:14:20,856 --> 00:14:23,096
All those who commit suicide come here after they die.

163
00:14:24,736 --> 00:14:26,736
Why does it seem even worse than the 18th level of hell?

164
00:14:26,896 --> 00:14:27,896
Of course it is.

165
00:14:28,656 --> 00:14:31,416
The sins of those who commit suicide are heavier than yours.

166
00:14:31,976 --> 00:14:33,296
How could the environment be good?

167
00:14:35,736 --> 00:14:37,016
There don't seem to be many ghosts here.

168
00:14:38,576 --> 00:14:40,096
Or is it just too dark to see?

169
00:14:48,936 --> 00:14:49,936
Let's keep looking.

170
00:15:11,456 --> 00:15:13,496
The recent suicides should be in these few rows.

171
00:15:26,016 --> 00:15:27,016
Is it this one?

172
00:15:29,456 --> 00:15:30,456
Lok.

173
00:15:36,776 --> 00:15:37,776
Lok.

174
00:15:43,096 --> 00:15:44,096
I'm sorry.

175
00:15:46,096 --> 00:15:47,336
Why are you here?

176
00:15:52,016 --> 00:15:53,816
Why were you so foolish to kill yourself?

177
00:15:55,296 --> 00:15:57,216
I clearly didn't do anything.

178
00:15:58,176 --> 00:16:00,256
Why wouldn't anyone believe me?

179
00:16:01,616 --> 00:16:02,896
So I thought...

180
00:16:03,656 --> 00:16:07,096
Fine, if you all want me dead so badly,

181
00:16:08,336 --> 00:16:09,816
I'll just die.

182
00:16:13,096 --> 00:16:14,296
Actually, I came here...

183
00:16:16,456 --> 00:16:17,976
to tell you the whole truth.

184
00:16:18,056 --> 00:16:19,456
I didn't want you to die in vain.

185
00:16:22,656 --> 00:16:23,776
Actually, I know Chan Fat.

186
00:16:25,536 --> 00:16:27,416
He forced me to set you up.

187
00:16:29,936 --> 00:16:30,936
Fat?

188
00:16:34,176 --> 00:16:36,456
So he really wanted me to be his scapegoat.

189
00:16:36,776 --> 00:16:38,176
You were in league with him!

190
00:16:38,816 --> 00:16:39,816
No.

191
00:16:39,976 --> 00:16:41,256
I didn't collude with him.

192
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:43,536
He's married to my aunt,

193
00:16:43,616 --> 00:16:45,736
and he used her life to threaten me.

194
00:16:50,256 --> 00:16:52,696
I found evidence that Chan Fat was the mastermind.

195
00:16:53,736 --> 00:16:54,936
But because I had to save my aunt,

196
00:16:55,016 --> 00:16:56,416
I told you to plead guilty first.

197
00:16:56,696 --> 00:16:57,896
Once my aunt was safe,

198
00:16:57,976 --> 00:16:59,416
I was going to present the evidence.

199
00:16:59,656 --> 00:17:02,136
You would've been acquitted at the retrial.

200
00:17:03,176 --> 00:17:05,696
I thought my plan was perfect,

201
00:17:05,936 --> 00:17:07,376
saving my aunt's life...

202
00:17:07,456 --> 00:17:08,896
while also clearing your name.

203
00:17:08,976 --> 00:17:11,456
But I miscalculated. I'm sorry.

204
00:17:13,576 --> 00:17:15,576
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

205
00:17:17,096 --> 00:17:18,336
I thought my life was over,

206
00:17:18,416 --> 00:17:19,696
so I committed suicide.

207
00:17:21,296 --> 00:17:23,096
If I had known about your plan,

208
00:17:23,456 --> 00:17:25,176
I wouldn't have had to die!

209
00:17:27,216 --> 00:17:28,376
I'm sorry, Lok.

210
00:17:30,656 --> 00:17:31,656
I'm sorry.

211
00:17:34,936 --> 00:17:37,016
But I'm going to appeal to the Emperor now.

212
00:17:38,416 --> 00:17:40,736
I'll tell him I'll pay you back with my life.

213
00:17:41,816 --> 00:17:43,216
Pay me back with your life?

214
00:17:43,296 --> 00:17:44,776
I'll pay you back with my life.

215
00:17:45,136 --> 00:17:47,256
It might not be enough, but I'll try.

216
00:17:48,096 --> 00:17:49,216
Anyway, I'll take responsibility.

217
00:17:50,816 --> 00:17:54,136
What you need to do now is stay calm.

218
00:17:55,456 --> 00:17:56,975
Because if your resentment is too deep,

219
00:17:56,976 --> 00:17:58,015
you'll shatter into fragments,

220
00:17:58,016 --> 00:17:59,296
and you won't be able to return to the living.

221
00:18:02,416 --> 00:18:03,496
If you bear in mind...

222
00:18:04,776 --> 00:18:05,856
that I didn't do it on purpose...

223
00:18:07,416 --> 00:18:09,136
and only did something bad with good intentions,

224
00:18:10,696 --> 00:18:11,936
would you be less angry then?

225
00:18:12,896 --> 00:18:14,536
If she hadn't found the evidence for you,

226
00:18:15,296 --> 00:18:17,656
you would've been imprisoned for 20 years because of Chan Fat.

227
00:18:19,776 --> 00:18:21,056
No matter how bad she was,

228
00:18:21,776 --> 00:18:23,456
she still helped find evidence to clear you.

229
00:18:24,616 --> 00:18:25,976
Does that make you feel a bit better?

230
00:18:31,056 --> 00:18:32,216
I guess so.

231
00:18:34,976 --> 00:18:36,496
Stay calm for now.

232
00:18:39,016 --> 00:18:40,416
Wait for my good news, okay?

233
00:19:04,416 --> 00:19:05,416
Wait.

234
00:19:11,936 --> 00:19:19,936
(Niche of Lui Ching Han)

235
00:20:08,376 --> 00:20:10,896
Mom, Grandpa, Grandma,

236
00:20:12,496 --> 00:20:15,336
I hope you'll help Amber down there...

237
00:20:16,896 --> 00:20:19,055
so she can come back safely soon.

238
00:20:19,056 --> 00:20:21,376
(Ho Oi Yuk and Cheng Fai Cho)

239
00:20:30,736 --> 00:20:33,416
Amber, I'm burning things for you.

240
00:20:35,736 --> 00:20:37,216
I hope you can use these.

241
00:20:39,176 --> 00:20:40,936
Find a way to come back soon.

242
00:20:59,098 --> 00:21:00,178
Is Amber still not back?

243
00:21:00,898 --> 00:21:01,898
Not yet.

244
00:21:02,058 --> 00:21:04,538
I sent her texts and voice messages,

245
00:21:04,618 --> 00:21:06,418
but she just told me to handle it myself.

246
00:21:06,658 --> 00:21:08,298
She has never been like this before, right?

247
00:21:08,458 --> 00:21:09,578
Of course not.

248
00:21:09,658 --> 00:21:11,058
When she was hospitalized last year,

249
00:21:11,138 --> 00:21:13,658
she gave me instructions before anesthesia.

250
00:21:51,738 --> 00:21:53,778
I suspect an accident happened in the unit.

251
00:21:53,858 --> 00:21:55,698
I can't get in. The address is...

252
00:21:56,098 --> 00:21:57,578
Amber is fine. She just doesn't want visitors.

253
00:21:57,658 --> 00:21:59,898
I'm not leaving until I see Amber today.

254
00:21:59,978 --> 00:22:01,498
Trust me, she's fine.

255
00:22:01,778 --> 00:22:04,298
She's fine in there.

256
00:22:15,698 --> 00:22:18,498
- Master! - It's not what you think!

257
00:22:18,578 --> 00:22:20,818
It's not what you think!

258
00:22:20,898 --> 00:22:21,978
Call the police!

259
00:22:22,058 --> 00:22:23,698
- Call the police! - Don't! She'll wake up!

260
00:22:23,778 --> 00:22:24,778
Call the police!

261
00:22:33,698 --> 00:22:34,698
Amber isn't dead yet.

262
00:22:35,058 --> 00:22:36,978
If you care for her, don't call the police.

263
00:23:03,418 --> 00:23:04,658
- Hello? - Ben.

264
00:23:04,818 --> 00:23:05,818
What are you up to now?

265
00:23:05,819 --> 00:23:07,698
The police came to the garage looking for you.

266
00:23:09,778 --> 00:23:10,938
I told them I didn't know where you were.

267
00:23:11,338 --> 00:23:13,418
But they said you committed murder.

268
00:23:13,498 --> 00:23:14,618
It's just a misunderstanding.

269
00:23:17,378 --> 00:23:18,458
Where are you now?

270
00:23:18,538 --> 00:23:20,058
Can you come back and explain it to them?

271
00:23:20,298 --> 00:23:21,418
I can't come back for now.

272
00:23:22,218 --> 00:23:23,898
Remember, don't let anyone touch the toy shelter.

273
00:26:22,978 --> 00:26:23,978
You're cheating.

274
00:26:24,098 --> 00:26:25,498
No, shuffle the cards now.

275
00:26:39,418 --> 00:26:41,458
Why is it that in the middle of the night,

276
00:26:41,898 --> 00:26:43,098
a handsome fellow...

277
00:26:43,178 --> 00:26:45,938
is moving such a big fridge into the hall?

278
00:26:46,258 --> 00:26:48,858
What is the reason for this?

279
00:26:51,418 --> 00:26:53,578
King Yama, I've done everything you said.

280
00:26:53,978 --> 00:26:56,138
I've done many good deeds and helped many people.

281
00:26:56,418 --> 00:26:58,258
Amber should have enough merit to return.

282
00:26:58,458 --> 00:26:59,738
When can she come back?

283
00:27:00,298 --> 00:27:01,498
When are you going to release her?

284
00:27:02,738 --> 00:27:03,818
I beg you.

285
00:27:05,858 --> 00:27:06,858
I beg you.

286
00:27:07,578 --> 00:27:10,538
I beg you.

287
00:27:11,618 --> 00:27:14,378
I beg you.

288
00:27:14,618 --> 00:27:18,218
- So it's related to Yama. - I beg you.

289
00:27:19,818 --> 00:27:23,458
Didn't he get demoted?

290
00:27:23,778 --> 00:27:25,578
Maybe it's because of this.

291
00:27:30,898 --> 00:27:32,218
I know she's actually a good person.

292
00:27:32,298 --> 00:27:33,298
She's not bad by nature.

293
00:27:33,299 --> 00:27:35,698
She just doesn't know how to express it.

294
00:27:40,418 --> 00:27:41,778
I can't live without her.

295
00:27:45,218 --> 00:27:46,818
Please give her a chance.

296
00:27:53,178 --> 00:27:54,698
Please give her a chance.

297
00:27:56,338 --> 00:27:57,698
If I can trade places with her,

298
00:27:57,778 --> 00:27:58,898
I'll do anything.

299
00:28:00,818 --> 00:28:02,098
Please give her a chance.

300
00:28:02,738 --> 00:28:04,018
Looks like something big is happening.

301
00:28:04,098 --> 00:28:05,578
Let's find a spot and watch the show.

302
00:28:08,818 --> 00:28:10,018
Hands up!

303
00:28:10,778 --> 00:28:12,578
Officer, I didn't commit murder.

304
00:28:12,858 --> 00:28:14,298
It's not what you think.

305
00:28:14,778 --> 00:28:16,738
I really didn't kill anyone. I didn't.

306
00:28:17,618 --> 00:28:18,618
Officer, I didn't kill anyone.

307
00:28:18,938 --> 00:28:19,938
Officer.

308
00:28:19,939 --> 00:28:21,298
- Sir, you're suspected of murder. - She's not dead.

309
00:28:21,378 --> 00:28:22,378
You are officially under arrest.

310
00:28:22,418 --> 00:28:24,058
She's not dead.

311
00:28:24,138 --> 00:28:25,178
She will wake up.

312
00:28:25,458 --> 00:28:26,458
Amber!

313
00:28:26,459 --> 00:28:27,858
Officer, please don't take her to the morgue.

314
00:28:27,938 --> 00:28:29,218
She's just sleeping. She'll wake up!

315
00:28:29,298 --> 00:28:30,298
She's not dead yet! Amber!

316
00:28:30,338 --> 00:28:34,658
Amber!

317
00:28:40,778 --> 00:28:41,778
Honey.

318
00:28:49,738 --> 00:28:50,738
Honey.

319
00:28:52,218 --> 00:28:54,258
My stomach hurts so much.

320
00:28:54,578 --> 00:28:56,618
Can you get me a glass of water?

321
00:29:09,258 --> 00:29:10,258
Honey.

322
00:29:47,298 --> 00:29:48,298
Hello?

323
00:29:50,338 --> 00:29:51,338
Speaking.

324
00:30:35,738 --> 00:30:37,898
Mrs. Chan, your niece's cause of death is unknown.

325
00:30:38,098 --> 00:30:40,058
We need your signature for the forensic autopsy.

326
00:30:40,418 --> 00:30:41,538
Who killed her?

327
00:30:41,658 --> 00:30:42,698
Please calm down first.

328
00:30:42,778 --> 00:30:44,538
Calm down. We're currently investigating.

329
00:30:44,618 --> 00:30:45,778
She can't just die like this.

330
00:30:45,858 --> 00:30:48,698
Who was it? Who killed her?

331
00:31:00,311 --> 00:31:01,311
Hey.

332
00:31:01,871 --> 00:31:02,871
I want to withdraw my money.

333
00:31:03,391 --> 00:31:05,111
Withdraw money? Are you playing tricks?

334
00:31:05,391 --> 00:31:07,111
You're a fugitive.

335
00:31:07,311 --> 00:31:08,991
If you withdraw money, the system will trigger an alarm.

336
00:31:09,071 --> 00:31:10,831
Once it goes off, all the ghosts will come to catch you.

337
00:31:11,031 --> 00:31:13,351
What? I'm penniless right now.

338
00:31:13,631 --> 00:31:14,911
We can't do anything.

339
00:31:15,631 --> 00:31:17,751
Don't stare at me with your eyes wide open.

340
00:31:17,831 --> 00:31:18,831
I don't have any money.

341
00:31:18,991 --> 00:31:20,191
What do we do without money?

342
00:31:20,791 --> 00:31:21,951
Everything here costs money.

343
00:31:22,271 --> 00:31:24,351
Don't ask me. This wasn't my idea.

344
00:31:24,751 --> 00:31:25,871
Then whose idea was it?

345
00:31:29,231 --> 00:31:30,231
Why are you here?

346
00:31:30,391 --> 00:31:31,391
It was his idea.

347
00:31:32,591 --> 00:31:35,111
How long does an appeal in the netherworld usually take?

348
00:31:35,431 --> 00:31:36,591
Do we have to wait long?

349
00:31:36,911 --> 00:31:38,750
I don't know. No ghost has ever appealed.

350
00:31:38,751 --> 00:31:39,751
You're the first case.

351
00:31:40,791 --> 00:31:42,191
What if it takes a long time?

352
00:31:42,511 --> 00:31:43,551
I've been dead for several days.

353
00:31:43,631 --> 00:31:45,311
I have no idea what's happening up there.

354
00:31:45,391 --> 00:31:46,591
I went up to check for you.

355
00:31:46,671 --> 00:31:47,991
Your body is safe for the time being.

356
00:31:50,271 --> 00:31:52,391
Don't overthink it. Let's go and return quickly.

357
00:31:55,911 --> 00:31:57,230
Random ghosts are not allowed to trespass...

358
00:31:57,231 --> 00:31:58,511
on the Emperor's grounds.

359
00:31:58,591 --> 00:32:00,631
What random ghost? I'm King Yama!

360
00:32:00,791 --> 00:32:02,031
I'm coming in right now.

361
00:32:03,191 --> 00:32:04,191
Careful.

362
00:32:04,951 --> 00:32:06,631
How can I appeal if I can't even see him?

363
00:32:12,391 --> 00:32:13,471
It's time for the patrol shift.

364
00:32:14,311 --> 00:32:15,751
If I don't go back now, my cover will be blown.

365
00:32:16,951 --> 00:32:19,631
King Yama, is this really going to work?

366
00:32:21,711 --> 00:32:22,711
I have to try it no matter what.

367
00:32:23,231 --> 00:32:25,311
Okay, I'll leave this shrew to you.

368
00:32:25,711 --> 00:32:27,431
- I'll wait for your good news. - Be careful.

369
00:32:31,631 --> 00:32:32,631
What should we do now?

370
00:32:43,871 --> 00:32:44,991
What are we doing here?

371
00:32:45,631 --> 00:32:46,631
Trust me.

372
00:32:48,831 --> 00:32:49,831
Put it on my tab.

373
00:32:50,231 --> 00:32:51,911
There's no need, King Yama.

374
00:32:51,991 --> 00:32:54,391
You're so handsome, it's hard not to recognize you.

375
00:32:55,671 --> 00:32:57,671
So? When are you being reinstated?

376
00:32:58,631 --> 00:33:01,111
The Emperor wants to give this place a makeover.

377
00:33:01,471 --> 00:33:03,831
Thousands of years of history, gone just like that.

378
00:33:05,071 --> 00:33:06,751
If you were still here, this wouldn't have happened.

379
00:33:07,191 --> 00:33:08,831
You miss me that much even after how I handled things?

380
00:33:09,391 --> 00:33:12,151
It would be fine if the new one was better than you.

381
00:33:13,231 --> 00:33:14,991
But unfortunately, each generation is worse than the last.

382
00:33:15,431 --> 00:33:17,391
Neither humans nor ghosts are perfect.

383
00:33:17,471 --> 00:33:19,591
Your humanity is your strength.

384
00:33:24,151 --> 00:33:26,071
- King Yama. - Yam Yam.

385
00:33:27,951 --> 00:33:29,711
My friend said he saw you here.

386
00:33:30,111 --> 00:33:31,551
So I came here to try my luck.

387
00:33:33,191 --> 00:33:34,991
You're the lawyer who helps us fulfill last wishes,

388
00:33:35,071 --> 00:33:36,071
Yau Yam Yam?

389
00:33:36,871 --> 00:33:39,951
Don't worry, we're all very grateful to you.

390
00:33:40,311 --> 00:33:41,831
We definitely won't report you.

391
00:33:45,831 --> 00:33:47,071
I came here...

392
00:33:47,471 --> 00:33:50,591
specifically to thank you in person.

393
00:33:51,671 --> 00:33:55,551
Thank you for fulfilling my last wish.

394
00:33:55,871 --> 00:33:57,511
I can now die without regrets.

395
00:33:58,951 --> 00:33:59,951
Thank you.

396
00:34:00,991 --> 00:34:02,711
What you did was really meaningful.

397
00:34:03,151 --> 00:34:04,470
Keep doing it if you get the chance.

398
00:34:04,471 --> 00:34:05,471
Yeah.

399
00:34:06,831 --> 00:34:07,831
Thank you.

400
00:34:09,191 --> 00:34:11,151
But unfortunately, we won't have the chance again.

401
00:34:11,591 --> 00:34:13,551
You caught the last train. You're lucky.

402
00:34:15,351 --> 00:34:17,591
Why don't we plead to the Emperor together?

403
00:34:18,591 --> 00:34:20,511
Let's hope he'll let them go.

404
00:34:21,391 --> 00:34:23,271
Are you crazy? How can we plead?

405
00:34:23,351 --> 00:34:25,230
By shouting outside?

406
00:34:25,231 --> 00:34:26,231
Exactly.

407
00:34:26,232 --> 00:34:28,271
Let's talk outside. Wait here for a while.

408
00:34:28,831 --> 00:34:30,551
- Let's go. - It won't work.

409
00:34:30,631 --> 00:34:33,591
Why not? There's always a way.

410
00:34:35,831 --> 00:34:39,351
With this appeal, the Emperor might suddenly get upset.

411
00:34:39,431 --> 00:34:42,071
With a wave of his hand, we'll both be turned into fragments.

412
00:34:43,231 --> 00:34:44,271
We're gambling with our lives.

413
00:34:44,591 --> 00:34:45,591
So...

414
00:34:46,791 --> 00:34:47,951
drink up while you can.

415
00:34:59,311 --> 00:35:00,311
I'm sorry.

416
00:35:01,791 --> 00:35:02,791
I've dragged you into this.

417
00:35:04,311 --> 00:35:06,511
Helping you return to life was my decision.

418
00:35:06,591 --> 00:35:08,191
I knew the risks involved.

419
00:35:08,711 --> 00:35:09,911
But I went ahead with it anyway.

420
00:35:10,631 --> 00:35:11,631
Because I don't want to be...

421
00:35:11,632 --> 00:35:13,511
a King of Hell who only knows how to deal out punishment.

422
00:35:16,591 --> 00:35:19,591
Both humans and gods make mistakes.

423
00:35:20,311 --> 00:35:21,551
The most important thing is...

424
00:35:23,151 --> 00:35:24,671
whether you have the heart to change.

425
00:35:29,711 --> 00:35:31,311
Why don't you lend me another coin?

426
00:35:38,031 --> 00:35:39,031
Go back and take a look.

427
00:35:39,951 --> 00:35:40,951
What about you?

428
00:35:42,151 --> 00:35:44,351
I'll see if there's a way to meet the Emperor.

429
00:36:06,111 --> 00:36:07,551
I'll always take care of you...

430
00:36:08,551 --> 00:36:11,951
until I've repaid everything I owe you.

431
00:36:18,791 --> 00:36:20,031
You're lying!

432
00:36:21,591 --> 00:36:23,951
You died before you could pay me back!

433
00:36:26,431 --> 00:36:27,711
What's wrong with you?

434
00:36:27,951 --> 00:36:29,351
Hitting me even in my dreams?

435
00:36:30,711 --> 00:36:32,991
I'm such an idiot, getting myself killed for your sake.

436
00:36:33,711 --> 00:36:35,151
You're the one who offended people out there,

437
00:36:35,391 --> 00:36:36,671
and now you're blaming me?

438
00:36:36,911 --> 00:36:39,431
It was for you that I helped that scumbag Chan Fat,

439
00:36:39,951 --> 00:36:41,711
causing an innocent young man to be wrongly imprisoned.

440
00:36:42,591 --> 00:36:44,831
He killed himself in jail, and now I have to go down with him.

441
00:36:45,311 --> 00:36:46,471
I have no idea what you're talking about.

442
00:36:47,951 --> 00:36:50,351
Well, great. Now I'm dead too.

443
00:36:50,431 --> 00:36:51,431
No one is left to help you.

444
00:36:51,671 --> 00:36:53,311
Only that scumbag is by your side.

445
00:36:53,591 --> 00:36:55,271
Soon, he'll swindle you out of everything...

446
00:36:55,351 --> 00:36:56,351
and then abandon you.

447
00:36:56,551 --> 00:36:58,311
You'll have no one and no money.

448
00:36:58,391 --> 00:36:59,591
If illness doesn't kill you, starvation will.

449
00:37:00,351 --> 00:37:01,831
I won't reincarnate so soon.

450
00:37:02,191 --> 00:37:04,111
I'll stay down here and watch you die.

451
00:37:04,751 --> 00:37:05,911
Since you see that illness hasn't killed me,

452
00:37:05,991 --> 00:37:07,271
you're trying to anger me to death!

453
00:37:08,951 --> 00:37:09,951
No.

454
00:37:10,191 --> 00:37:11,511
I didn't come here to fight with you.

455
00:37:12,311 --> 00:37:13,711
I came to tell you this.

456
00:37:14,311 --> 00:37:15,831
Don't cremate me.

457
00:37:16,071 --> 00:37:17,471
Don't let them perform an autopsy.

458
00:37:18,311 --> 00:37:19,311
I'll be back.

459
00:37:22,831 --> 00:37:23,831
Honey.

460
00:37:24,391 --> 00:37:25,391
Did you have a nightmare?

461
00:37:26,791 --> 00:37:27,871
It's fine.

462
00:37:29,471 --> 00:37:30,551
I'm sorry, honey.

463
00:37:31,311 --> 00:37:33,871
I was in a bad mood and lost my temper.

464
00:37:38,431 --> 00:37:41,791
I saw the news about your niece.

465
00:37:42,631 --> 00:37:43,631
How are you holding up?

466
00:37:46,471 --> 00:37:47,471
I'm fine.

467
00:37:49,431 --> 00:37:51,351
Is it time to start preparing for the funeral?

468
00:37:52,671 --> 00:37:53,951
These things are a hassle.

469
00:37:54,551 --> 00:37:55,591
Let me handle it for you, okay?

470
00:37:56,271 --> 00:37:59,071
I'm exhausted. I don't want to think about it.

471
00:38:00,351 --> 00:38:01,831
But you have to.

472
00:38:02,271 --> 00:38:04,711
We can't let her stay in the morgue for so long.

473
00:38:04,791 --> 00:38:07,471
Fat, I'm hungry.

474
00:38:08,071 --> 00:38:09,911
Go buy me a bowl of mung bean soup.

475
00:38:12,831 --> 00:38:13,831
We'll talk when I get back.

476
00:38:26,991 --> 00:38:28,031
Are you Cheng Fong Ting?

477
00:38:28,951 --> 00:38:29,951
Yes, I am.

478
00:38:29,952 --> 00:38:31,911
I'm Ho Cheuk Yiu, Kowloon West Regional Crime Unit.

479
00:38:32,591 --> 00:38:34,591
I need you to sign the autopsy consent form for Yau Yam Yam.

480
00:38:37,991 --> 00:38:38,991
I won't sign it.

481
00:38:41,671 --> 00:38:42,831
She died an unnatural death,

482
00:38:43,871 --> 00:38:45,271
and it involves criminal elements.

483
00:38:45,711 --> 00:38:47,511
An autopsy is required to determine the cause of death.

484
00:38:48,471 --> 00:38:49,991
The forensic report will help us find the killer.

485
00:38:50,431 --> 00:38:51,671
I said I'm not signing it.

486
00:38:55,671 --> 00:38:57,071
If you insist on not signing,

487
00:38:57,151 --> 00:38:58,351
you can apply for an exemption.

488
00:38:58,751 --> 00:39:00,511
But the coroner usually won't grant it.

489
00:39:07,111 --> 00:39:08,111
It hurts.

490
00:39:08,351 --> 00:39:11,751
Doctor, help me.

491
00:39:12,791 --> 00:39:14,311
- Nurse. - How are you?

492
00:39:14,391 --> 00:39:15,591
It hurts so much.

493
00:39:15,751 --> 00:39:18,311
My stomach is cramping in waves. It hurts.

494
00:39:18,391 --> 00:39:20,071
Could you please come back later?

495
00:39:20,151 --> 00:39:21,151
It hurts.

496
00:39:21,431 --> 00:39:23,191
Do you need some painkillers?

497
00:39:23,271 --> 00:39:26,151
It's so painful. Painkillers won't help.

498
00:39:27,911 --> 00:39:29,471
No need.

499
00:39:29,751 --> 00:39:30,751
No need.

500
00:39:31,231 --> 00:39:33,951
- I want to see the doctor. - Okay.

501
00:39:36,151 --> 00:39:37,431
Around 11pm last night,

502
00:39:37,511 --> 00:39:38,951
police found a body hidden in a freezer...

503
00:39:39,031 --> 00:39:40,911
at the Man Mo Temple in Sheung Wan.

504
00:39:41,031 --> 00:39:43,071
The deceased is identified as barrister Yau Yam Yam.

505
00:39:43,351 --> 00:39:44,551
Police arrested a 25-year-old man...

506
00:39:44,631 --> 00:39:46,271
surnamed Kam at the scene.

507
00:39:46,511 --> 00:39:47,991
He is suspected of murder.

508
00:39:48,071 --> 00:39:49,071
The case is being followed up...

509
00:39:49,072 --> 00:39:50,431
by the Hong Kong Island Regional Crime Unit.

510
00:39:51,951 --> 00:39:54,951
(Wife)

511
00:40:18,511 --> 00:40:19,511
Master.

512
00:40:29,471 --> 00:40:31,791
I'm running out of time. I need your help.

513
00:40:38,031 --> 00:40:41,511
(Dream Visitation)

514
00:40:44,671 --> 00:40:46,510
The person you chose for the dream visitation...

515
00:40:46,511 --> 00:40:47,911
is not yet asleep.

516
00:40:48,471 --> 00:40:50,831
Please try again later.

517
00:40:51,471 --> 00:40:52,791
Your chosen dream object...

518
00:40:52,871 --> 00:40:54,151
is not asleep yet.

519
00:40:54,231 --> 00:40:55,671
Please try again later.

520
00:40:56,031 --> 00:40:57,471
The person you chose...

521
00:41:16,711 --> 00:41:17,751
Why is this happening?

522
00:41:33,791 --> 00:41:35,071
Is this your solution?

523
00:41:35,631 --> 00:41:37,031
This way, we'll definitely be able to see the Emperor.

524
00:41:37,111 --> 00:41:38,111
Let's go.
